  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.42 with immutable ProGPU preview.48; adopts exact transformed, dashed, fixed-width, shader-backed, and hairline stroke replay, adaptive device-error curve subdivision, allocation-free indexed stroke recording, and preserved DXF cosmetic strokes without a bridge workaround; retains the typed, zero-allocation media drawing-state seam, native activation, popup-local input diagnostics, bounded render-resource ownership, and static-frame render suppression; and preserves the Windows OLE clipboard and cross-platform input, popup, theme, WPFGallery, and designer gates.",
